sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User\n(Investigator/Analyst)
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend\nVanilla JS + Ethers.js
    participant Auth as 🔐 Auth Service\nJWT + ECDSA
    participant API as ⚡ API Gateway\nExpress + Rate Limit
    participant EvidenceSvc as 📁 Evidence Service\nProcessing Pipeline
    participant IPFS as 📦 IPFS/Pinata\nDecentralized Storage
    participant Blockchain as ⛓️ Blockchain\nPolygon + Contract
    participant DB as 🐘 Supabase\nPostgreSQL + RLS
    participant WS as 🔌 WebSocket\nReal-time Notifications
    participant Audit as 📋 Audit Log\nImmutable Trail

    Note over User, Audit: 🔐 Phase 1: Authentication & Authorization
    User->>Frontend: Connect MetaMask / Email Login
    Frontend->>Auth: Request Nonce (Wallet) / Credentials (Email)
    Auth-->>Frontend: Nonce Challenge / JWT Token
    Frontend->>User: Sign Message (ECDSA) / Enter Password
    User->>Frontend: Signature / Credentials
    Frontend->>Auth: Verify Signature / Validate JWT
    Auth-->>Frontend: ✅ Authenticated + Role
    Auth->>DB: Log Login Activity
    
    Note over User, Audit: 📤 Phase 2: Evidence Upload
    User->>Frontend: Select File + Metadata\n(Case, Description, Tags)
    Frontend->>Frontend: Client-side Validation\nType, Size, Hash Preview
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/evidence/upload\nMultipart + Auth Headers
    API->>API: Rate Limit Check\n(50/hr upload limit)
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT / Wallet Sig
    Auth-->>API: ✅ Authorized + Role
    API->>EvidenceSvc: Process Evidence
    
    par Parallel Processing
        EvidenceSvc->>EvidenceSvc: 🔐 SHA-256 Hash\nGenerate File Fingerprint
        EvidenceSvc->>EvidenceSvc: 🎨 Watermark + Compress\nSharp + PDF-Lib
        EvidenceSvc->>EvidenceSvc: 📋 Extract Metadata\nEXIF, C2PA, File Info
    end
    
    Note over User, Audit: 🌐 Phase 3: IPFS Storage
    EvidenceSvc->>IPFS: Upload File + Metadata\nPinata API
    IPFS-->>EvidenceSvc: ✅ CID Generated\nQmXxx... / bafy...
    EvidenceSvc->>DB: Store CID + Metadata\nPending Blockchain
    
    Note over User, Audit: ⛓️ Phase 4: Blockchain Anchoring
    EvidenceSvc->>Blockchain: Prepare Transaction\nHash + Metadata JSON
    Blockchain->>Blockchain: Estimate Gas\nOptimize Cost
    Blockchain->>Contract: storeEvidence(hash, metadata)
    Contract-->>Blockchain: ✅ Tx Hash + Block #
    Blockchain->>Explorer: Verify on Polygonscan
    Blockchain-->>EvidenceSvc: ✅ Confirmed (2 blocks)
    
    Note over User, Audit: 💾 Phase 5: Database Persistence
    EvidenceSvc->>DB: INSERT evidence\nHash, CID, TxHash, Block#, Gas
    DB-->>EvidenceSvc: ✅ Evidence ID Created
    EvidenceSvc->>DB: Link to Case\nUpdate Case Evidence Count
    EvidenceSvc->>Audit: Log Upload Event\nUser, File, Hash, CID, Tx
    
    Note over User, Audit: 🔔 Phase 6: Real-time Notification
    EvidenceSvc->>WS: Emit 'evidence:uploaded'\nCase Room + Role Rooms
    WS-->>User: 📱 Push Notification\n"Evidence Added to Case #123"
    WS-->>Team: 👥 Team Alert\nRole-based Distribution
    
    Note over User, Audit: ✅ Phase 7: Response
    EvidenceSvc-->>API: {success, evidenceId, txHash, cid}
    API-->>Frontend: 201 Created + Data
    Frontend-->>User: 🎉 Success UI\nVerification Links
    
    Note over User, Audit: 🔍 Phase 8: Verification (Anytime)
    User->>Frontend: Click "Verify on Blockchain"
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/evidence/:id/blockchain-proof
    API->>Blockchain: verifyHash(fileHash)
    Blockchain->>Contract: verifyHash(hash)
    Contract-->>Blockchain: {exists: true, evidenceId}
    Blockchain-->>API: Verification Result
    API-->>Frontend: Proof Data + Explorer URL
    Frontend-->>User: 🔗 Polygonscan Link\n✅ Verified Badge
